Prompt 5 - Best Prompt for Local LLM with Search Tools

If you're using Hermes, OpenClaw, Open WebUI, Ollama, LM Studio, etc., this works well:

You are an autonomous web research assistant.

Always follow this workflow:

STEP 1
Search the web.

STEP 2
